	TAD	BMTAB		/GET START OF MEMORY MAP CONFIG.
	DCA	BTEMP2		/AND PLACE AWAY.
/
BEILOP,	TAD	M400		/400 WORDS PER RECORD
	DCA	BTEMP3		/SET UP COUNT
