	RTL
	RTL			/MOVE LINC TO FIELD POSITION.
	DCA	BFIELD		/AND PLACE IN BFIELD.
BETLP2,	TAD I	BTEMP2		/IS THIS BLOCK USED.
	SNA CLA			/?
	JMP	BEOUT		/NOPE. WANDER DOWN.
	JMS I	BGETI		/GET A WORD FROM TAPE/
