BTAPE,	0			/MAIN TAPE OUTPUTER.
	TAD	BFIELD		/LAST TIME THROUGH?
	IAC
	SNA CLA			/?
	JMP I	BTEND		/YEP. CLOSE FILE.
	TAD	BFIELD		/GET THE FIELD
	CIA
	TAD	BOFIELD		/SAME AS LAST ONE?
